\f1\b What do R, F, L, and D mean in the End column?\

\f0\b0 \
These are codes for how the game ended. Most games end in resignation (R). A game can also end by Forfeit (somebody ran out of time), Loss (the opponent actually connected his sides of the board), or Draw (which must be agreed upon).\
